  (text "ATX/KVM SAFETY & TODO(hw-verify) NOTES (docs/WIRING.md §6.4)\n- Invariant 4: NEVER change KVM_A0/A1 while any ~E is Low.\n  Sequence: All ~E High -> change A0/A1 -> wait setup -> single ~E Low.\n- Fail-safe on ESP reset (High-Z): R5..R7 (10k PU) disable ALL 74HC139\n  outputs; R3/R4 (100k PD) hold A0/A1 = 00 (CH1).\n- Verify 74HC139 sink current vs photorelay If [C1/C3]; add NPN buffer if needed.\n- Verify KVM button common wire & LED voltage/polarity/PWM [A1..A8, C2].\n- Firmware disables internal GPIO PU/PD on LED pins; external 10k PU/PD mandatory!" (exclude_from_sim no)
